1
00:01:06,840 --> 00:01:08,760
Keep in touch often after you get to Beijing.

2
00:01:08,760 --> 00:01:10,620
Let us know you're safe every day.

3
00:01:12,840 --> 00:01:15,170
Got it. I promise to complete the mission.

4
00:01:18,280 --> 00:01:19,360
Where is Zhang Yang?

5
00:01:19,360 --> 00:01:20,400
Look at the time.

6
00:01:20,640 --> 00:01:21,680
He's sick.

7
00:01:21,680 --> 00:01:22,880
He said he was afraid of infecting everyone,

8
00:01:22,880 --> 00:01:24,440
so he won't come to see you off.

9
00:01:24,440 --> 00:01:25,960
He was fine yesterday.

10
00:01:27,880 --> 00:01:29,680
Well, people are only human.

11
00:01:29,680 --> 00:01:31,010
Getting sick is normal.

12
00:01:31,120 --> 00:01:31,600
Xinyue,

13
00:01:31,840 --> 00:01:32,960
after you get to Beijing,

14
00:01:32,960 --> 00:01:35,420
I'll ask Mr. Zhang to sneeze for you on video,

15
00:01:35,560 --> 00:01:37,440
as a long-distance farewell.

16
00:01:37,880 --> 00:01:38,680
Okay.

17
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:41,600
It's fine if he doesn't come.

18
00:01:45,479 --> 00:01:47,280
Sister.

19
00:01:52,240 --> 00:01:54,840
Remember to bring me some local specialties,

20
00:01:55,880 --> 00:01:57,680
not the kind that fool tourists.

21
00:01:59,560 --> 00:02:01,240
You really are my sister.

22
00:02:02,440 --> 00:02:04,300
Go quickly. Don't miss the train.

23
00:02:04,880 --> 00:02:05,480
Come here.

24
00:02:06,080 --> 00:02:07,680
Let's have a little ceremony.

25
00:02:07,680 --> 00:02:08,120
Yes.

26
00:02:08,320 --> 00:02:09,380
Xinyue, come here.

27
00:02:17,400 --> 00:02:18,280
Li Xinyue.

28
00:02:18,520 --> 00:02:19,680
Good luck.

29
00:04:07,600 --> 00:04:08,480
Hello.

30
00:04:08,800 --> 00:04:09,440
Hello.

31
00:04:09,800 --> 00:04:11,280
Hello. I'm sorry, Miss Li.

32
00:04:11,280 --> 00:04:12,720
Sorry to keep you waiting.

33
00:04:12,720 --> 00:04:14,640
The offer letter has just been sent to your email.

34
00:04:14,640 --> 00:04:15,640
Please check it.

35
00:04:17,959 --> 00:04:18,519
Hello?

36
00:04:19,079 --> 00:04:19,640
Miss Li?

37
00:04:21,800 --> 00:04:22,600
No.

38
00:04:24,040 --> 00:04:25,840
I should be the one apologizing.

39
00:04:30,320 --> 00:04:31,120
Hello?

40
00:04:32,159 --> 00:04:33,760
Is the plane taking off soon?

41
00:04:37,200 --> 00:04:37,800
Almost.

42
00:04:39,840 --> 00:04:41,240
Did you pack everything?

43
00:04:41,800 --> 00:04:43,530
Did you leave anything behind?

44
00:04:44,000 --> 00:04:44,600
I think so.

45
00:04:45,480 --> 00:04:46,880
What's wrong, Mr. Zhang?

46
00:04:47,400 --> 00:04:49,520
Are you going to bring me tissues?

47
00:04:51,960 --> 00:04:53,560
I won't charge you this time.

48
00:04:56,920 --> 00:04:57,780
What about you?

49
00:04:58,800 --> 00:04:59,860
What are you doing?

50
00:05:01,520 --> 00:05:02,160
Me?

51
00:05:05,400 --> 00:05:06,760
Nan'an is quite nice.

52
00:05:07,480 --> 00:05:08,680
If you take your time,

53
00:05:09,240 --> 00:05:11,040
you'll always find new scenery.

54
00:05:13,400 --> 00:05:14,240
Yeah.

55
00:05:21,320 --> 00:05:21,960
All right.

56
00:05:23,520 --> 00:05:24,580
Have a safe flight.

57
00:05:28,160 --> 00:05:28,960
You too.

58
00:05:30,200 --> 00:05:31,000
Stay safe.

59
00:05:59,960 --> 00:06:00,760
Tell me,

60
00:06:00,960 --> 00:06:03,620
where do you think Mr. Zhang is crying right now?

61
00:06:04,240 --> 00:06:05,280
I doubt it.

62
00:06:05,280 --> 00:06:06,740
He seems pretty carefree.

63
00:06:07,280 --> 00:06:08,600
That's just on the surface.

64
00:06:08,600 --> 00:06:11,600
Deep down, he values relationships more than anyone.

65
00:06:12,040 --> 00:06:12,600
True.

66
00:06:13,120 --> 00:06:14,780
That night under the big tree,

67
00:06:14,840 --> 00:06:16,640
his eyes were shining so bright.

68
00:06:16,840 --> 00:06:18,880
But in the end, Li Xinyue still left.

69
00:06:19,360 --> 00:06:21,560
Actually, I can understand Xinyue.

70
00:06:22,080 --> 00:06:23,680
The opportunities in Beijing are so good.

71
00:06:23,680 --> 00:06:25,680
People always want to climb higher.

72
00:06:26,400 --> 00:06:29,730
When you're young, you always want to prove yourself first.

73
00:06:31,560 --> 00:06:33,890
Then I guess it wasn't meant to be for them.

74
00:06:34,720 --> 00:06:36,480
What do you mean by that?

75
00:06:36,560 --> 00:06:39,360
Long-distance relationships are also possible.

76
00:06:39,760 --> 00:06:41,360
One has taken root in Nan'an,

77
00:06:41,440 --> 00:06:43,440
and the other is just starting out in Beijing.

78
00:06:43,440 --> 00:06:44,840
Time and space

79
00:06:44,840 --> 00:06:45,900
are both problems.

80
00:06:47,240 --> 00:06:48,400
Wait, is Zhang Yang still coming?

81
00:06:48,400 --> 00:06:49,680
Look at the time.

82
00:06:50,000 --> 00:06:51,000
Let's wait a bit longer.

83
00:06:51,000 --> 00:06:52,159
Anyway, Xinyue isn't here,

84
00:06:52,159 --> 00:06:54,960
and there's nothing going on at the travel agency.

85
00:06:56,400 --> 00:06:57,400
Zhang Yang.

86
00:07:05,800 --> 00:07:06,840
We are at the cafe.

87
00:07:08,480 --> 00:07:09,280
What?

88
00:07:10,960 --> 00:07:11,760
Okay.

89
00:07:12,840 --> 00:07:13,640
What's wrong?

90
00:07:13,680 --> 00:07:14,640
What did he say?

91
00:07:15,280 --> 00:07:16,960
He said he's not coming to the cafe.

92
00:07:16,960 --> 00:07:18,220
Not coming to the cafe?

93
00:07:18,280 --> 00:07:19,540
Then where is he going?

94
00:07:20,240 --> 00:07:22,640
He said he'll see us at the homestay later.

95
00:07:23,280 --> 00:07:24,080
Is that all?

96
00:07:24,480 --> 00:07:25,280
He didn't cry?

97
00:07:25,560 --> 00:07:26,080
No.

98
00:07:26,600 --> 00:07:28,000
He sounded quite normal.

99
00:07:28,600 --> 00:07:31,080
He also said there's a meeting later.

100
00:07:32,760 --> 00:07:34,159
What's going on?

101
00:07:34,400 --> 00:07:35,600
He finished being sad

102
00:07:35,800 --> 00:07:36,640
and moved on?

103
00:07:37,280 --> 00:07:39,640
Maybe he wasn't sad at all.

104
00:07:42,760 --> 00:07:44,040
We'll know later.

105
00:07:51,320 --> 00:07:52,320
Come here.

106
00:07:52,320 --> 00:07:53,920
Everyone sit down.

107
00:07:54,320 --> 00:07:56,960
I am the acting manager of this travel agency.

108
00:07:56,960 --> 00:07:59,320
I hereby convene our first meeting.

109
00:07:59,560 --> 00:08:00,560
There are two things.

110
00:08:00,560 --> 00:08:01,960
I'll keep it brief.

111
00:08:02,080 --> 00:08:03,360
Li Xinyue isn't here again.

112
00:08:03,360 --> 00:08:04,880
Can't we slack off for a bit?

113
00:08:04,880 --> 00:08:07,160
Who says I'm not here?

114
00:08:08,640 --> 00:08:09,360
She

115
00:08:09,440 --> 00:08:11,280
has decided to stay in Nan'an.

116
00:08:11,440 --> 00:08:12,770
That's the first thing.

117
00:08:20,880 --> 00:08:22,160
This is the second thing.

118
00:08:22,160 --> 00:08:22,920
Meeting adjourned.

119
00:08:22,920 --> 00:08:23,920
Stop right there.

120
00:08:24,560 --> 00:08:25,720
Let's have a meeting.

121
00:08:25,720 --> 00:08:27,050
Tell us what's going on.

122
00:08:27,760 --> 00:08:29,690
You even hid this from your sister.

123
00:08:31,480 --> 00:08:33,200
You were the one who gave the advice.

124
00:08:33,200 --> 00:08:34,240
I'm flattered.

125
00:08:48,520 --> 00:08:48,960
Slow down.

126
00:08:48,960 --> 00:08:49,760
It's fine.

127
00:08:53,880 --> 00:08:55,210
How can you be like this?

128
00:09:12,720 --> 00:09:13,600
The Babadeng lantern team

129
00:09:13,600 --> 00:09:15,120
is about to pass by our shop.

130
00:09:15,120 --> 00:09:16,600
Are you two still going to watch?

131
00:09:16,600 --> 00:09:17,800
They won't go.

132
00:09:17,920 --> 00:09:19,000
They are dating.

133
00:09:19,400 --> 00:09:19,930
Let's go,

134
00:09:20,240 --> 00:09:21,040
sis.

135
00:09:36,840 --> 00:09:37,520
So beautiful.

136
00:09:37,520 --> 00:09:38,720
What is this?

137
00:09:38,720 --> 00:09:40,320
This is Yingdu's Babandeng.

138
00:09:40,440 --> 00:09:43,240
It parades here every year on the ninth day of the first lunar month.

139
00:09:43,240 --> 00:09:44,840
It's a national intangible cultural heritage.

140
00:09:44,840 --> 00:09:46,040
Spectacular, right?

141
00:09:46,760 --> 00:09:48,720
Babandeng, prosper every year.

142
00:09:50,000 --> 00:09:51,520
What are you saying?

143
00:09:51,600 --> 00:09:52,800
It's Hokkien.

144
00:09:52,960 --> 00:09:53,760
It means

145
00:09:53,840 --> 00:09:55,640
Babandeng, prosper every year.

146
00:09:56,400 --> 00:09:57,680
Prosper every year.

147
00:09:57,880 --> 00:09:59,480
Awesome. You can speak Hokkien.

148
00:09:59,480 --> 00:10:02,480
It means making money every day and praying for peace.

149
00:10:21,000 --> 00:10:24,240
I always wanted to be successful so much.

150
00:10:25,160 --> 00:10:26,960
But when that day really comes,

151
00:10:27,600 --> 00:10:29,240
I feel lost.

152
00:10:30,120 --> 00:10:32,240
What exactly is success?

153
00:10:32,760 --> 00:10:33,960
A lot of money?

154
00:10:34,440 --> 00:10:35,920
A desirable job?

155
00:10:36,760 --> 00:10:37,640
Or

156
00:10:38,320 --> 00:10:39,880
a desirable romance?

157
00:10:41,720 --> 00:10:42,760
Later I realized,

158
00:10:43,560 --> 00:10:44,880
success

159
00:10:46,760 --> 00:10:47,760
success

160
00:10:48,280 --> 00:10:51,960
is spending my life the way I like.

161
00:11:16,760 --> 00:11:17,560
You...

162
00:11:18,640 --> 00:11:19,570
Why are you here?

163
00:11:21,720 --> 00:11:22,840
I said 'soon'.

164
00:11:22,960 --> 00:11:24,620
I didn't say I'd already left.

165
00:11:27,240 --> 00:11:28,040
Li Xinyue.

166
00:11:28,800 --> 00:11:29,560
You are really...

167
00:11:29,560 --> 00:11:30,880
Really unlovable.

168
00:11:37,160 --> 00:11:40,020
You really make it impossible for me not to love you.

169
00:11:41,440 --> 00:11:42,760
I can't help it.

170
00:11:43,960 --> 00:11:45,760
Since I am your kryptonite.

171
00:11:49,960 --> 00:11:51,160
Unforgettable.

172
00:11:53,040 --> 00:11:54,160
You didn't expect

173
00:11:55,160 --> 00:11:57,120
we'd reunite so soon, did you?

174
00:12:02,520 --> 00:12:03,920
Actually, it's not a reunion.
